          "id": "L001",
          "speaker": "FINLEY",
          "speakerLabel": "芬利",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "visual": "BLACK",
          "text": "停一下。你是不是玩錯了？"
        },
        {
          "id": "L002",
          "speaker": "FINLEY",
          "speakerLabel": "芬利",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "visual": "BLACK",
          "text": "我還以為你在等誰來幫忙。後來一看，嗯，能幫的人你都快得罪完了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "L003",
          "speaker": "FINLEY",
          "speakerLabel": "芬利",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "visual": "BLACK",
          "text": "條約倒是寫好了。她的名字在最後，只差簽字。"
        },
        {
          "id": "L004",
          "speaker": "FINLEY",
          "speakerLabel": "芬利",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "visual": "BLACK",
          "text": "你想看內容啊？"
        },
        {
          "id": "L005",
          "speaker": "FINLEY",
          "speakerLabel": "芬利",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "visual": "BLACK",
          "text": "他們也沒打算給她看。"
